      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "/usr/share/mime/subclasses DOES contain a mapping of subclass relationships of mime types (like types of imags)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "I have handled SOME of this and MAY have a good enuf API as of Stroika 2.1b2.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "PERHAPS as simple as - adding to BackendCode methods to gather 'isa' relationships.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Add to InternetMediaTypeRegistry::OverrideRecord an optional Set<InternetMediaType> fIsARelationships;",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "THen can use existing AddOverride mechansim to add relationships like HF-Format-V2 ISA HF-Format, etc and more generally any relationship I want/need. UNCLEAR if these relationshops should IGNORE parameters? when doing comparison?",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
